{"suttaId":"sn9.11","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[2961,2967],"vripara":"231"},"segments":{"sn9.11:0.3":"Akusalavitakkasuttaṃ","sn9.11:1.1":"Ekaṃ samayaṃ aññataro bhikkhu kosalesu viharati aññatarasmiṃ vanasaṇḍe.","sn9.11:1.2":"Tena kho pana samayena so bhikkhu divāvihāragato pāpake akusale vitakke vitakketi, seyyathidaṃ –","sn9.11:1.3":"kāmavitakkaṃ, byāpādavitakkaṃ, vihiṃsāvitakkaṃ.","sn9.11:1.4":"Atha kho yā tasmiṃ vanasaṇḍe adhivatthā devatā tassa bhikkhuno anukampikā atthakāmā taṃ bhikkhuṃ saṃvejetukāmā yena so bhikkhu tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā taṃ bhikkhuṃ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi –","sn9.11:2.1":"“Ayoniso manasikārā,","sn9.11:2.2":"so vitakkehi khajjasi;","sn9.11:2.3":"Ayoniso [ayoniṃ (pī. ka.)] paṭinissajja,","sn9.11:2.4":"yoniso anucintaya.","sn9.11:3.1":"“Satthāraṃ dhammamārabbha,","sn9.11:3.2":"saṅghaṃ sīlāni attano;","sn9.11:3.3":"Adhigacchasi pāmojjaṃ,","sn9.11:3.4":"pītisukhamasaṃsayaṃ;","sn9.11:3.5":"Tato pāmojjabahulo,","sn9.11:3.6":"dukkhassantaṃ karissasī”ti.","sn9.11:4.1":"Atha kho so bhikkhu tāya devatāya saṃvejito saṃvegamāpādīti."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":1254,"to":1254,"paras":[{"para":1254,"vripara":"231","refs":["sn9.11:1","sn9.11:2","sn9.11:3"],"lines":["Ekādasame <b>akusale vitakke</b>ti kāmavitakkādayo tayo mahāvitakke.","<b>Ayoniso manasikārā</b>ti anupāyamanasikārena.","<b>So</b>ti so tvaṃ.","<b>Ayoniso paṭinissajjā</b>ti etaṃ anupāyamanasikāraṃ vajjehi.","<b>Satthāran</b>ti imāya gāthāya pāsādikakammaṭṭhānaṃ katheti.","<b>Pītisukhamasaṃsayan</b>ti ekaṃseneva balavapītiñca sukhañca adhigamissasi.","Ekādasamaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn9.11:1"],["sn9.11:2"],["sn9.11:2"],["sn9.11:2"],["sn9.11:3"],["sn9.11:3"],["sn9.11:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn9.11:1.2","akusale vitakke",0,0],["sn9.11:2.1","ayoniso manasikārā",0,1],["sn9.11:2.1","so",0,2],["sn9.11:2.3","so",0,2],["sn9.11:2.3","ayoniso paṭinissajjā",0,3],["sn9.11:3.1","satthāraṃ",0,4],["sn9.11:3.3","pītisukhamasaṃsayaṃ",0,5]],"before":[{"para":1253,"vripara":null,"title":"Akusalavitakkasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Akusalavitakkasuttavaṇṇanā"]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":1467,"to":1467,"paras":[{"para":1467,"vripara":"231","refs":["sn9.11:1"],"lines":["<b>Akusale vitakke</b>ti akosallasambhūtaṭṭhena akusale micchāvitakke.","Yoni vuccati upāyo, tasmā asubhādike subhādivasena manasikāro ayonisomanasikāroti āha <b>“anupāyamanasikārenā”</b>ti.","<b>Pāsādikakammaṭṭhānan</b>ti pasādāvahaṃ buddhānussatiādikammaṭṭhānaṃ.","<b>Balavapītiñca sukhañcā</b>ti nīvaraṇavikkhambhanato balavantaṃ upacārajjhānasahagataṃ pītiñca sukhañca."],"lineRefs":[["sn9.11:1"],["sn9.11:1"],["sn9.11:1"],["sn9.11:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn9.11:1.2","akusale vitakke",0,0]],"before":[{"para":1466,"vripara":null,"title":"Akusalavitakkasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Akusalavitakkasuttavaṇṇanā"]}],"after":[{"para":1468,"vripara":null,"title":"Akusalavitakkasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Akusalavitakkasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]}]},"tika2":null}
